{
  "title": "Budgets / Cost Explorer · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "비용을 분석하고 예산과 사용량 변화에 맞춰 대응합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Budgets / Cost Explorer</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#guide-1\">비용을 분석하고 예산 설정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#guide-2\">절감 조치를 실제 사용에 맞추기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>운영·비용</span><span>07 / 62</span></div><h1>Budgets / Cost Explorer</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Cost Explorer와 AWS Budgets는 <strong>클라우드 비용을 이해하고 관리하는 서비스</strong>입니다. Cost Explorer는 어디에 비용이 발생했는지 분석하고, Budgets는 정한 예산과 비교해 알림을 보내는 데 사용합니다.</p><p>요금 합계만 보는 것보다 서비스·계정·프로젝트별로 비용을 나누면 줄일 수 있는 원인을 찾기 쉽습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-cost-explorer\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-budgets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"budget-actions\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cost-allocation-tags-and-cost-categories\"></span><h2>비용을 분석하고 예산 설정</h2><p>Cost Explorer에서 기간과 서비스, 계정 등의 기준으로 비용 추이를 살펴봅니다. 비용 할당 태그<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 준비하면 프로젝트나 환경별 비용을 구분하는 데 활용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>Budgets에 비용이나 사용량 예산을 정하고 실제 또는 예상 값이 기준에 도달하면 알림을 보냅니다. 비용 이상 탐지로 평소와 다른 증가를 확인할 수도 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"data-exports-and-cost-and-usage-reports\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cost-anomaly-detection\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"compute-optimizer-and-right-sizing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"commitments-and-total-cost\"></span><h2>절감 조치를 실제 사용에 맞추기</h2><p>사용하지 않는 리소스 정리, 과도한 서버 크기 조정, 저장 계층 변경부터 검토합니다. Compute Optimizer 등의 권고도 애플리케이션 성능 요구와 함께 판단합니다.</p><p>예산 알림은 모든 지출을 실시간으로 자동 차단하는 장치가 아닙니다. 자동 조치를 사용하려면 지원 범위와 영향을 설정하고, 할인 약정은 꾸준한 사용량을 확인한 뒤 적용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>비용 관리의 반복 과정</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>비용 구분</strong><span>서비스·계정·태그</span></li><li><strong>원인 분석</strong><span>증가와 낭비 확인</span></li><li><strong>개선·알림</strong><span>크기 조정·예산 설정</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">절감 후에도 성능과 실제 요금 변화를 함께 관찰합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>개발 환경의 비용이 늘어난 원인을 태그별로 분석해 야간에 계속 켜진 서버를 찾습니다. 운영 시간을 조정하고 월 예산 알림을 설정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>비용 할당 태그</strong> — 리소스에 붙인 프로젝트·부서 등의 태그를 비용 분류에 활용하는 기능입니다. 태그 부착과 비용 할당 태그 활성화를 함께 준비합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cost-management/latest/userguide/ce-what-is.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Analyzing your costs and usage with AWS Cost Explorer ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cost-management/latest/userguide/budgets-managing-costs.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Managing your costs with AWS Budgets ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q004\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q004\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q004</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Cost optimization and reliability requirements appear to conflict. What is the best architectural decision?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Increase only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Evaluate business RPO and RTO requirements alongside cost</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Replicate every system across multiple Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Always choose the least expensive single-AZ deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a>는 여러 기둥의 요구와 균형을 함께 평가한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q035\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q035\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q035</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q035/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a stable level of compute usage over a long period. Which commitment-based option can reduce costs compared with On-Demand usage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q035\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 일정 사용량 약정과 교환해 할인한다. 약정 범위와 유형은 사용 패턴에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q080\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q080\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q080</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q080/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs an alert when its monthly AWS cost approaches a planned threshold. What should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q080\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q080\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Budgets</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q080\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q080\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-budgets\">Budgets</a>는 예산 임계값과 실제·예측 비용 알림에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q081\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q081\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q081</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q081/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to analyze whether NAT gateways or data transfer caused a cost increase over time. Which tool is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Cost Explorer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">SQS visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a>로 서비스와 기간별 비용 추세를 분석한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q098\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">이전 용어 <b>AZ</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">다음 용어 <b>CloudFormation</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
